    "To order education, add «alstublieft» (please, formal): «Een kopje thee, alstublieft» (A cup of tea, please). To order the account: «De rekening, alstublieft». For the payment method it is distinguished: «contant» (cash) or «pinnen» (pay by debit card, necessary verb in the Netherlands). «Wilt u nog iets?» means «You want anything else?»."
